  (text "NFC batteryless e-ink tag" (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 4 4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d3f02073-f81d-477b-b17d-d9f1efe8dd0e))
  (text "Recommended design: NT3H2211 (ISO 14443-A harvest + SRAM pass-through)\\n+ STM32G071CBT6 + TPS61023 + GDEY042T81 4.2 in 400x300.\\nPhone field powers the board. MCU streams the image, paints the panel, then the rail collapses." (at 20 32 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a192facf-ccff-419e-8b7a-0bb13c0768ac))
  (text "Session: couple phone to the bezel antenna -> harvest charges VSTORE ->\\nboost reaches 3.3 V -> supervisor releases PF2-NRST -> MCU boots ->\\nSRAM mailbox drain over I2C -> enable EPD rail -> SSD1683 refresh -> deep sleep / field gone." (at 20 52 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 94f79687-6bcc-4695-b273-c4dc5dc39db3))
  (text "Do not hang bulk capacitance on NTAG VOUT. NXP limits that pin to 220 nF.\\nCharge the tank through R1 (22 ohm) and a Schottky. Keep the phone on the coil for the whole refresh." (at 20 72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 397a7937-7741-443e-b44f-9d2836de21a6))
  (text "Board outline equals the GDEY042T81 module (91 mm x 77 mm).\\nRoute a 2-turn Class-1 loop in the bezel; keep copper pour out of the antenna keepout.\\nSee README.md for alternate designs (ST25DV, FM1280 module, 2.13 in, 5.83 in)." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d52ca8af-9007-4273-a79a-e4ef5e67380d))
